# Upgrade unlock names

When the user names a parent upgrade for **new unlocks**, do not guess which roman-numeral variant they mean.

If they give a generic family name (for example `Heavier Hits`, `Bigger Stick`, or `Richer Breaks`) **without** I, II, III…, stop and ask which one before adding nodes or wiring the tree.

Only proceed without asking when they already specified the numeral, or the name is unique on the tree (no I/II siblings).
